35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The billing is based on area, not heads. Empty desks still cost us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Minato,,The printer row is nine decibels louder. My chair needs days to settle.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Upstairs, setting up took four to nine minutes. Shuffles last two weeks.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The plan gives four window seats. Badge times show early and late arrivals.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Badge times are split. New joiners learned by overhearing conversations.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, if we fix seats, we pay 6,200 yen per desk to move power.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, if we rotate, I lose my chair settings every time.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, fixed desks mean no setup time, but we pay to move them.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, if we use free address, the early birds pick the window seats.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, but then I might sit next to someone I don't talk to.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,The cost of changing fixed desks is high. We should minimize moves.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Minato,,I prefer stability for my body. Rotating blocks sound painful.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"Free address saves setup time, but the morning chaos is real.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Fixed desks by function seems fair if we assign the bad seats deliberately.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I worry free address isolates me. Fixed desks might be safer.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I lean towards fixed desks to avoid repeated facility costs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Minato,,I agree. Stability is key for my comfort.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I can accept fixed desks if the morning routine is smooth.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,Fixed desks allow us to control the distribution of good and bad seats.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I think fixed desks help me build consistent relationships.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
